<title>USA: Silverado names Timothy Bruer president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Silverado names Timothy Bruer president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silverado Foods Inc said Wednesday that Timothy Bruer has joined the company as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Gerald Milton has resigned his position as president but will continue to serve on the board of directors.</p>
<p>Bruer takes over the chief executive title from chairman and chief executive officer Lawrence Field. Field remains chairman.</p>
<p>Bruer most recently served as vice president/general Manager of the Culinary Division of Nestle USA.</p>
